The important finding
The current cubic seam already is the 2021 parabola rule.
curve_lab/bezier.py and pythagorean-spiral/spans.py both use
\[
\text{arm}=\frac{|chord|}{3\cos^2(\theta/2)}
=\frac{2|chord|}{3(1+\cos\theta)}
\]
So there is no separate fitted option to switch to. The comparison is a validation of the existing seam, not a replacement.
